t the most popular kinds of apples worldwide on our TYPO3 Demo Project.\";s:6:\"module\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"extendToSubpages\";i:0;s:6:\"author\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"author_email\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"nav_title\";s:15:\"Kinds of apples\";s:8:\"nav_hide\";i:0;s:16:\"content_from_pid\";i:0;s:9:\"mount_pid\";i:0;s:12:\"mount_pid_ol\";i:0;s:8:\"l18n_cfg\";i:0;s:14:\"backend_layout\";s:20:\"pagets__Overviewpage\";s:25:\"backend_layout_next_level\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"tsconfig_includes\";N;s:9:\"seo_title\";s:36:\"Kinds of apples - TYPO3 Demo Project\";s:8:\"no_index\";i:0;s:9:\"no_follow\";i:0;s:8:\"og_title\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"og_description\";N;s:8:\"og_image\";i:0;s:13:\"twitter_title\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"twitter_description\";N;s:13:\"twitter_image\";i:0;s:12:\"twitter_card\";s:7:\"summary\";s:14:\"canonical_link\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"sitemap_priority\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:18:\"sitemap_changefreq\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"categories\";i:0;s:15:\"infotext_header\";s:53:\"More information about the â€œKinds of applesâ€ page\";s:8:\"infotext\";s:1265:\"<p>This page, and the <a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=4\" target=\"_top\">\"Recipes\" page</a> are both Overview page types.<br /> Overview pages are&nbsp;divided into three sections:</p>\r\n<ul> 	<li>Stage content</li> 	<li>Main content</li> 	<li>Teaser content</li> </ul>\r\n<p>You will notice that in the Stage content and the Teaser content section,&nbsp;you can only insert a certain content type. This&nbsp;helps editors \"build\" pages without having to worry about the frontend design.</p>\r\n<p>In the Teaser content section, you can insert the content type <strong>Teaser list of all subpages</strong>. This&nbsp;is a very practical content type that makes it easy for editors to display teasers of certain pages (in this case kinds of apples or recipes). All information for the teasers (like title, teaser text and teaser image) are edited on the recipe or apple page itself. For example,&nbsp;to change the teaser image for a certain recipe, you need to go into the page properties of that particular recipe and edit the data there.</p>\r\n<p>This way you can make sure that all data&nbsp;will be changed on every page immediately.&nbsp;It also saves you time because&nbsp;you don\'t have to find every single page the teaser is used on.</p>\";s:21:\"tx_schema_webpagetype\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"link\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"subpages\";a:10:{i:17;a:79:{s:3:\"uid\";i:17;s:3:\"pid\";i:3;s:6:\"tstamp\";i:1643191211;s:6:\"crdate\";i:1601841692;s:7:\"deleted\";i:0;s:6:\"hidden\";i:0;s:9:\"starttime\";i:0;s:7:\"endtime\";i:0;s:8:\"fe_group\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"sorting\";i:256;s:14:\"rowDescription\";N;s:8:\"editlock\";i:0;s:16:\"sys_language_uid\";i:0;s:11:\"l10n_parent\";i:0;s:11:\"l10n_source\";i:0;s:10:\"l10n_state\";N;s:15:\"l10n_diffsource\";s:564:\"{\"doktype\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"slug\":\"\",\"nav_title\":\"\",\"abstract\":\"\",\"media\":\"\",\"seo_title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"no_index\":\"\",\"no_follow\":\"\",\"canonical_link\":\"\",\"tx_schema_webpagetype\":\"\",\"sitemap_changefreq\":\"\",\"sitemap_priority\":\"\",\"og_title\":\"\",\"og_description\":\"\",\"og_image\":\"\",\"twitter_title\":\"\",\"twitter_description\":\"\",\"twitter_image\":\"\",\"twitter_card\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"target\":\"\",\"cache_tags\":\"\",\"is_siteroot\":\"\",\"no_search\":\"\",\"tsconfig_includes\":\"\",\"hidden\":\"\",\"nav_hide\":\"\",\"fe_group\":\"\",\"editlock\":\"\",\"infotext_header\":\"\",\"infotext\":\"\",\"backend_layout\":\"\"}\";s:9:\"t3ver_oid\";i:0;s:10:\"t3ver_wsid\";i:0;s:11:\"t3ver_state\";i:0;s:11:\"t3ver_stage\";i:0;s:12:\"perms_userid\";i:1;s:13:\"perms_groupid\";i:1;s:10:\"perms_user\";i:31;s:11:\"perms_group\";i:31;s:15:\"perms_everybody\";i:1;s:5:\"title\";s:16:\"Belle de Boskoop\";s:4:\"slug\";s:22:\"/kind-of-apples/boskop\";s:7:\"doktype\";i:11;s:8:\"TSconfig\";N;s:11:\"is_siteroot\";i:0;s:13:\"php_tree_stop\";i:0;s:8:\"shortcut\";i:0;s:13:\"shortcut_mode\";i:0;s:8:\"subtitle\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"lay