;i:1643192179;s:8:\"abstract\";s:95:\"Frequently asked questions about apples - you will find some answers on the TYPO3 demo project!\";s:6:\"module\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"extendToSubpages\";i:0;s:6:\"author\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"author_email\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"nav_title\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"nav_hide\";i:0;s:16:\"content_from_pid\";i:0;s:9:\"mount_pid\";i:0;s:12:\"mount_pid_ol\";i:0;s:8:\"l18n_cfg\";i:0;s:14:\"backend_layout\";s:15:\"pagets__Faqpage\";s:25:\"backend_layout_next_level\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"tsconfig_includes\";N;s:9:\"seo_title\";s:50:\"FAQ on Apples - Answered on the TYPO3 Demo project\";s:8:\"no_index\";i:0;s:9:\"no_follow\";i:0;s:8:\"og_title\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"og_description\";N;s:8:\"og_image\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"twitter_title\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"twitter_description\";N;s:13:\"twitter_image\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"twitter_card\";s:7:\"summary\";s:14:\"canonical_link\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"sitemap_priority\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:18:\"sitemap_changefreq\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"categories\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"infotext_header\";s:41:\"More information about the â€œFAQâ€ page\";s:8:\"infotext\";s:881:\"<p>The FAQ page is a regular content page that is divided into two sections: the stage and main content.</p>\r\n<p>The FAQ is a <a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/faq\" target=\"_top\">custom-built backend module</a>. You can see it in the module menu on the left of the screen.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>When adding content to this page, we went to the <strong>Special elements</strong> tab to insert the \'FAQ Listing\' content type. This inserts all FAQs from the <a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/faq\" target=\"_top\">FAQ module</a>. The questions will disappear from the page&nbsp;as soon as they are&nbsp;deleted or hidden, and will display on the page as soon as they are unhidden, or a new question is created.</p>\r\n<p>That makes it easy for editors because they don\'t need to worry about manually adjusting questions whenever something changes in the FAQ area.</p>\";s:21:\"tx_schema_webpagetype\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"link\";s:0:\"\";}i:0;a:78:{s:3:\"uid\";i:1;s:3:\"pid\";i:0;s:6:\"tstamp\";i:1666592511;s:6:\"crdate\";i:1601645180;s:7:\"deleted\";i:0;s:6:\"hidden\";i:0;s:9:\"starttime\";i:0;s:7:\"endtime\";i:0;s:8:\"fe_group\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"sorting\";i:512;s:14:\"rowDescription\";N;s:8:\"editlock\";i:0;s:16:\"sys_language_uid\";i:0;s:11:\"l10n_parent\";i:0;s:11:\"l10n_source\";i:0;s:10:\"l10n_state\";N;s:15:\"l10n_diffsource\";s:580:\"{\"doktype\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"slug\":\"\",\"nav_title\":\"\",\"seo_title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"no_index\":\"\",\"no_follow\":\"\",\"canonical_link\":\"\",\"tx_schema_webpagetype\":\"\",\"sitemap_changefreq\":\"\",\"sitemap_priority\":\"\",\"og_title\":\"\",\"og_description\":\"\",\"og_image\":\"\",\"twitter_title\":\"\",\"twitter_description\":\"\",\"twitter_image\":\"\",\"twitter_card\":\"\",\"abstract\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"target\":\"\",\"cache_tags\":\"\",\"is_siteroot\":\"\",\"no_search\":\"\",\"no_search_sub_entries\":\"\",\"tsconfig_includes\":\"\",\"hidden\":\"\",\"nav_hide\":\"\",\"fe_group\":\"\",\"editlock\":\"\",\"infotext_header\":\"\",\"infotext\":\"\",\"backend_layout\":\"\"}\";s:9:\"t3ver_oid\";i:0;s:10:\"t3ver_wsid\";i:0;s:11:\"t3ver_state\";i:0;s:11:\"t3ver_stage\";i:0;s:12:\"perms_userid\";i:1;s:13:\"perms_groupid\";i:1;s:10:\"perms_user\";i:31;s:11:\"perms_group\";i:31;s:15:\"perms_everybody\";i:1;s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"TYPO3 Demo Site\";s:4:\"slug\";s:1:\"/\";s:7:\"doktype\";i:10;s:8:\"TSconfig\";N;s:11:\"is_siteroot\";i:1;s:13:\"php_tree_stop\";i:0;s:8:\"shortcut\";i:0;s:13:\"shortcut_mode\";i:0;s:8:\"subtitle\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"layout\";i:0;s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"media\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"lastUpdated\";i:0;s:8:\"keywords\";s:47:\"TYPO3, CMS, Demo, Open Source, Experience TYPO3\";s:13:\"cache_timeout\";i:0;s:10:\"cache_tags\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"newUntil\";i:0;s:11:\"description\";s:132:\"Get an insight on how the CMS TYPO3 works, log in to the backend, edit and delete content and experience TYPO3â€™s amazing features.\";s:9:\"no_search\";i:0;s:15:\"SYS_LASTCHANGED\";i:1666592511;s:8:\"abstract\";s:130:\"Get an insight on how the CMS TYPO3 works, log in to the backend, edit and delete content and experience TYPO3\'s amazing features.\";s:6:\"module\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"extendToSubpages\";i:0;s:6:\"author\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"author_email\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"nav_title\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"nav_hide\";i:0;s:16:\"content_from_pid\";i:0;s:9:\"mount_pid\";i:0;s:12:\"mount_pid_ol\";i:0;s:8:\"l18n_cfg\";i:0;s:14:\"backend_layout\";s:17:\"pagets__Startpage\";s:25:\"backend_layout_next_level\";s:19:\"pagets__Contentpage\";s:17:\"tsconfig_includes\";N;s:9:\"seo_title\";s:18:\"TYPO3 Demo Project\";s:8:\"no_index\";i:0;s:9:\"no_follow\";i:0;s:8:\"og_title\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"og_description\";N;s:8:\"og_image\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"twitter_title\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"twitter_description\";N;s:13:\"twitter_image\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"twitter_card\";s:7:\"summary\";s:14:\"canonical_link\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"sitemap_priority\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:18:\"sitemap_changefreq\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"categories\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"infotext_header\";s:35:\"More information about this project\";s:8:\"infotext\";s:1887:\"<p>The workspace of the TYPO3 backend is divided into three sections:</p>\r\n<ol> 	<li>The module menu on the left of the screen</li> 	<li>The page tree - its structure represents the sitemap of your website</li> 	<li>The content area where you can edit pages and content elements</li> </ol>\r\n<p>This project uses several different page types:</p>\r\n<ul> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=1\" target=\"_top\">Start page</a></li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=17\" target=\"_top\">Apple page</a> (specifically configured for this project)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=39\" target=\"_top\">Recipe page</a> (specifically configured for this project)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=4\" target=\"_top\">Overview page</a> (specifically configured for this project)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=96\" target=\"_top\">Content page</a>&nbsp;(specifically configured for this project)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=7\" target=\"_top\">Shortcut</a> (default TYPO3 page type)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=12\" target=\"_top\">Link to external URLs</a> (default TYPO3 page type)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=11\" target=\"_top\">Folder</a> (default TYPO3 page type)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=52\" target=\"_top\">Content page with restricted access for frontend users</a> (default TYPO3 page type;&nbsp;this&nbsp;is for pages that are only shown to users who are logged in to the frontend)</li> </ul>\r\n<p>These different page types have pre-defined content sections that provide a guideline for structuring content on the page, making it easy for editors to create and \"build\" pages.</p>\";s:21:\"tx_schema_webpagetype\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"link\";s:0:\"\";}}'),
