s:0:\"\";s:8:\"nav_hide\";i:1;s:16:\"content_from_pid\";i:0;s:9:\"mount_pid\";i:0;s:12:\"mount_pid_ol\";i:0;s:8:\"l18n_cfg\";i:0;s:14:\"backend_layout\";s:19:\"pagets__Contentpage\";s:25:\"backend_layout_next_level\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"tsconfig_includes\";N;s:9:\"seo_title\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"no_index\";i:0;s:9:\"no_follow\";i:0;s:8:\"og_title\";s:0:\"\";s:14:\"og_description\";N;s:8:\"og_image\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"twitter_title\";s:0:\"\";s:19:\"twitter_description\";N;s:13:\"twitter_image\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"twitter_card\";s:7:\"summary\";s:14:\"canonical_link\";s:0:\"\";s:16:\"sitemap_priority\";s:3:\"0.5\";s:18:\"sitemap_changefreq\";s:0:\"\";s:10:\"categories\";s:0:\"\";s:15:\"infotext_header\";s:43:\"More information about the â€œLoginâ€ page\";s:8:\"infotext\";s:977:\"<p>This page allows you to login to a restricted area of&nbsp;the frontend.</p>\r\n<p>The frontend login functionality is an out-of-the-box feature included with TYPO3,&nbsp;that lets you restrict pages or&nbsp;content to specific frontend usergroups.</p>\r\n<p>To see it in action, log in to the frontend. You\'ll be able to see the Secrets about apples page. Next, head to the Fun Facts page and you\'ll be able to see a piece of content that is only visible for logged-in users.</p>\r\n<p>To restrict content or pages to certain usergroups,&nbsp;use the <strong>Access </strong>tab in the content type or in the page properties and set the usergroup.</p>\r\n<p>For this project, usergroups and users are stored centrally in the <strong><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/list?id=51\" target=\"_top\">Frontend Users</a></strong> folder. You won\'t be able to edit these, but switch to the List module&nbsp;and click on the folder to see the usergroup and user we created.</p>\";s:21:\"tx_schema_webpagetype\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"link\";s:0:\"\";}i:0;a:78:{s:3:\"uid\";i:1;s:3:\"pid\";i:0;s:6:\"tstamp\";i:1666592511;s:6:\"crdate\";i:1601645180;s:7:\"deleted\";i:0;s:6:\"hidden\";i:0;s:9:\"starttime\";i:0;s:7:\"endtime\";i:0;s:8:\"fe_group\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"sorting\";i:512;s:14:\"rowDescription\";N;s:8:\"editlock\";i:0;s:16:\"sys_language_uid\";i:0;s:11:\"l10n_parent\";i:0;s:11:\"l10n_source\";i:0;s:10:\"l10n_state\";N;s:15:\"l10n_diffsource\";s:580:\"{\"doktype\":\"\",\"title\":\"\",\"slug\":\"\",\"nav_title\":\"\",\"seo_title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"no_index\":\"\",\"no_follow\":\"\",\"canonical_link\":\"\",\"tx_schema_webpagetype\":\"\",\"sitemap_changefreq\":\"\",\"sitemap_priority\":\"\",\"og_title\":\"\",\"og_description\":\"\",\"og_image\":\"\",\"twitter_title\":\"\",\"twitter_description\":\"\",\"twitter_image\":\"\",\"twitter_card\":\"\",\"abstract\":\"\",\"keywords\":\"\",\"target\":\"\",\"cache_tags\":\"\",\"is_siteroot\":\"\",\"no_search\":\"\",\"no_search_sub_entries\":\"\",\"tsconfig_includes\":\"\",\"hidden\":\"\",\"nav_hide\":\"\",\"fe_group\":\"\",\"editlock\":\"\",\"infotext_header\":\"\",\"infotext\":\"\",\"backend_layout\":\"\"}\";s:9:\"t3ver_oid\";i:0;s:10:\"t3ver_wsid\";i:0;s:11:\"t3ver_state\";i:0;s:11:\"t3ver_stage\";i:0;s:12:\"perms_userid\";i:1;s:13:\"perms_groupid\";i:1;s:10:\"perms_user\";i:31;s:11:\"perms_group\";i:31;s:15:\"perms_everybody\";i:1;s:5:\"title\";s:15:\"TYPO3 Demo Site\";s:4:\"slug\";s:1:\"/\";s:7:\"doktype\";i:10;s:8:\"TSconfig\";N;s:11:\"is_siteroot\";i:1;s:13:\"php_tree_stop\";i:0;s:8:\"shortcut\";i:0;s:13:\"shortcut_mode\";i:0;s:8:\"subtitle\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"layout\";i:0;s:6:\"target\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"media\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"lastUpdated\";i:0;s:8:\"keywords\";s:47:\"TYPO3, CMS, Demo, Open Source, Experience TYPO3\";s:13:\"cache_timeout\";i:0;s:10:\"cache_tags\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"newUntil\";i:0;s:11:\"description\";s:132:\"Get an insight on how the CMS TYPO3 works, log in to the backend, edit and delete content and experience TYPO3â€™s amazing features.\";s:9:\"no_search\";i:0;s:15:\"SYS_LASTCHANGED\";i:1666592511;s:8:\"abstract\";s:130:\"Get an insight on how the CMS TYPO3 works, log in to the backend, edit and delete content 