(47,0,1666592511,1602710645,0,0,0,0,'',512,NULL,0,1,1,1,'{\"starttime\":\"parent\",\"endtime\":\"parent\",\"nav_hide\":\"parent\",\"url\":\"parent\",\"lastUpdated\":\"parent\",\"newUntil\":\"parent\",\"no_search\":\"parent\",\"shortcut\":\"parent\",\"shortcut_mode\":\"parent\",\"content_from_pid\":\"parent\",\"author\":\"parent\",\"author_email\":\"parent\",\"media\":\"parent\",\"og_image\":\"parent\",\"twitter_image\":\"parent\",\"tx_schema_webpagetype\":\"parent\",\"no_search_sub_entries\":\"parent\"}','{\"doktype\":10,\"title\":\"TYPO3 Demo Site\",\"slug\":\"\\/\",\"nav_title\":\"\",\"subtitle\":\"\",\"seo_title\":\"TYPO3 Demo Project\",\"description\":\"Get an insight on how the CMS TYPO3 works, log in to the backend, edit and delete content and experience TYPO3\'s amazing features.\",\"canonical_link\":\"\",\"sitemap_changefreq\":\"\",\"sitemap_priority\":\"0.5\",\"og_title\":\"\",\"og_description\":null,\"twitter_title\":\"\",\"twitter_description\":null,\"twitter_card\":\"summary\",\"abstract\":\"Get an insight on how the CMS TYPO3 works, log in to the backend, edit and delete content and experience TYPO3\'s amazing features.\",\"keywords\":\"TYPO3, CMS, Demo, Open Source, Experience TYPO3\",\"hidden\":0,\"categories\":0,\"rowDescription\":null,\"TSconfig\":\"\",\"php_tree_stop\":\"0\",\"editlock\":\"0\",\"layout\":\"0\",\"fe_group\":\"\",\"extendToSubpages\":\"0\",\"target\":\"\",\"cache_timeout\":\"0\",\"cache_tags\":\"\",\"mount_pid\":\"0\",\"is_siteroot\":\"1\",\"mount_pid_ol\":\"0\",\"module\":\"\",\"fe_login_mode\":\"0\",\"l18n_cfg\":\"0\",\"backend_layout\":\"pagets__Startpage\",\"backend_layout_next_level\":\"pagets__Contentpage\",\"tsconfig_includes\":\"\",\"no_index\":\"0\",\"no_follow\":\"0\",\"starttime\":\"0\",\"endtime\":\"0\",\"nav_hide\":\"0\",\"url\":\"\",\"lastUpdated\":\"0\",\"newUntil\":\"0\",\"no_search\":\"0\",\"shortcut\":\"0\",\"shortcut_mode\":\"0\",\"content_from_pid\":\"0\",\"author\":\"\",\"author_email\":\"\",\"media\":\"0\",\"og_image\":\"0\",\"twitter_image\":\"0\",\"infotext_header\":\"More information about this project\",\"infotext\":\"<p>The workspace of the TYPO3 backend is divided into three sections:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ol> \\t<li>The module menu on the left of the screen<\\/li> \\t<li>The page tree - its structure represents the sitemap of your website<\\/li> \\t<li>The content area where you can edit pages and content elements<\\/li> <\\/ol>\\r\\n<p>This project uses several different page types:<\\/p>\\r\\n<ul> \\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/demo.typo3.org\\/typo3\\/module\\/web\\/layout?id=1\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">Start page<\\/a><\\/li> \\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/demo.typo3.org\\/typo3\\/module\\/web\\/layout?id=17\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">Apple page<\\/a> (specifically configured for this project)<\\/li> \\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/demo.typo3.org\\/typo3\\/module\\/web\\/layout?id=39\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">Recipe page<\\/a> (specifically configured for this project)<\\/li> \\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/demo.typo3.org\\/typo3\\/module\\/web\\/layout?id=4\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">Overview page<\\/a> (specifically configured for this project)<\\/li> \\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/demo.typo3.org\\/typo3\\/module\\/web\\/layout?id=96\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">Content page<\\/a>&nbsp;(specifically configured for this project)<\\/li> \\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/demo.typo3.org\\/typo3\\/module\\/web\\/layout?id=7\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">Shortcut<\\/a> (default TYPO3 page type)<\\/li> \\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/demo.typo3.org\\/typo3\\/module\\/web\\/layout?id=12\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">Link to external URLs<\\/a> (default TYPO3 page type)<\\/li> \\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/demo.typo3.org\\/typo3\\/module\\/web\\/layout?id=11\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">Folder<\\/a> (default TYPO3 page type)<\\/li> \\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/demo.typo3.org\\/typo3\\/module\\/web\\/layout?id=52\\\" target=\\\"_top\\\">Content page with restricted access for frontend users<\\/a> (default TYPO3 page type;&nbsp;this&nbsp;is for pages that are only shown to users who are logged in to the frontend)<\\/li> <\\/ul>\\r\\n<p>These different page types have pre-defined content sections that provide a guideline for structuring content on the page, making it easy for editors to create and \\\"build\\\" pages.<\\/p>\",\"tx_schema_webpagetype\":\"\",\"no_search_sub_entries\":\"0\"}',0,0,0,0,1,1,31,31,1,'TYPO3 Demo-Webseite','/',10,NULL,1,0,0,0,'',0,'',0,0,'TYPO3, CMS, Demo, Open Source, TYPO3 testen',0,'',0,'Lerne das CMS TYPO3 besser kennen, logge Dich ins Backend ein, Ã¤ndere und lÃ¶sche Inhalte und erlebe die vielen Features, die TYPO3 bietet.',0,1666592511,'Lerne das CMS TYPO3 besser kennen, logge Dich ins Backend ein, Ã¤ndere und lÃ¶sche Inhalte und erlebe die vielen Features, die TYPO3 bietet.','',0,'','','',0,0,0,0,0,'pagets__Startpage','pagets__Contentpage','','TYPO3 Demoprojekt',0,0,'',NULL,0,'',NULL,0,'summary','',0.5,'',0,'More information about this project','<p>The workspace of the TYPO3 backend is divided into three sections:</p>\r\n<ol> 	<li>The module menu on the left of the screen</li> 	<li>The page tree - its structure represents the sitemap of your website</li> 	<li>The content area where you can edit pages and content elements</li> </ol>\r\n<p>This project uses several different page types:</p>\r\n<ul> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=1\" target=\"_top\">Start page</a></li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=17\" target=\"_top\">Apple page</a> (specifically configured for this project)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=39\" target=\"_top\">Recipe page</a> (specifically configured for this project)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=4\" target=\"_top\">Overview page</a> (specifically configured for this project)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=96\" target=\"_top\">Content page</a>&nbsp;(specifically configured for this project)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=7\" target=\"_top\">Shortcut</a> (default TYPO3 page type)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=12\" target=\"_top\">Link to external URLs</a> (default TYPO3 page type)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=11\" target=\"_top\">Folder</a> (default TYPO3 page type)</li> 	<li><a href=\"https://demo.typo3.org/typo3/module/web/layout?id=52\" target=\"_top\">Content page with restricted access for frontend users</a> (default TYPO3 page type;&nbsp;this&nbsp;is for pages that are only shown to users who are logged in to the frontend)</li> </ul>\r\n<p>These different page types have pre-defined content sections that provide a guideline for structuring content on the page, making it easy for editors to create and \"build\" pages.</p>','',''),
