(245,'',44,1606749855,1606749452,0,0,0,0,'',704,0,1,50,50,NULL,'{\"CType\":\"textmedia\",\"colPos\":0,\"header\":\"Directions\",\"header_layout\":\"2\",\"bodytext\":\"<p><strong>Step 1<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Add oats to your container of choice and pour in milk and low-fat yogurt.&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Step 2<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Add in a layer of chopped apples, and top off with cinnamon, drizzle of honey, and chia seeds.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><strong>Step 3<\\/strong><\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Place in fridge and enjoy in the morning or a few hours later! Let steep for at least 8 hours in a refrigerator 40\\u00b0 F or colder. Best to eat within 24 hours.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><sup>Recipe from&nbsp;https:\\/\\/www.quakeroats.com\\/cooking-and-recipes\\/apple-cinnamon-overnight-oats<\\/sup><\\/p>\",\"assets\":0,\"imageorient\":0,\"sys_language_uid\":0,\"hidden\":0,\"starttime\":0,\"endtime\":0,\"fe_group\":\"\",\"editlock\":0,\"rowDescription\":\"\",\"l18n_parent\":0}',0,0,0,0,'textmedia','Zubereitung','','<p><strong>Schritt&nbsp;1</strong></p>\r\n<p>Haferflocken in den BehÃ¤lter Deiner Wahl fÃ¼hlen und die Milch und den Joghurt hinzugeben.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Schritt 2</strong></p>\r\n<p>Geschnittene Ã„pfel darÃ¼berlegen, Zimt, Honig und Chia Seeds darÃ¼berstreuen.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Schritt 3</strong></p>\r\n<p>In den KÃ¼hlschrank stellen und am nÃ¤chsten Morgen genieÃŸen!<br /> Das Overnight Oat sollte mindestens 8 Stunden im KÃ¼hlschrank bei 4Â°C oder kÃ¤lter ruhen. Am besten innerhalb von 24 Stunden verzehren.</p>\r\n<p><sup>Rezept von&nbsp;https://www.quakeroats.com/cooking-and-recipes/apple-cinnamon-overnight-oats</sup></p>',0,0,0,0,0,0,0,2,0,0,'','default',0,'','','','',0,'','',0,2,1,0,'',0,'','','',0,0,0,NULL,'','','',NULL,124,0,0,0,0,'','',''),
